# Security remediation runbook. This repository is PUBLIC. db/ documents database
# structure and vulnerabilities that are NOT fixed yet (Phase 4: the anon key is
# still published and RLS still allows anon UPDATE), so publishing it would hand an
# attacker a roadmap while those credentials are live.
# Remove this rule only after Phase 4 is done, or move db/ to a private repo.
db/

